# name: apple-location-services
# priority: 039
# section: apple
# description: 定位与 Find My 已识别的专用端点
# boundary: 含已核对的 Find My 移动端入口和数字分片。共用 iCloud 网页、推送和账户保留各自策略。
# created-at: 2026-11-19T10:51:17Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-19T12:33:32Z
# rule-count: 11
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/enriquephl/QuantumultX_config/main/ClashRuleSet/Loon/AppleExtra/LocationServices.list
# source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/elianokk/Shunt_Rules/main/rule/Loon/FindMy.lsr
# source: https://support.apple.com/en-us/104978
# source: https://dns.google/resolve?name=p01-fmipmobile.icloud.com&type=A
# source: https://dns.google/resolve?name=p131-fmipmobile.icloud.com&type=A
# source: https://dns.google/resolve?name=p01-fmfmobile.icloud.com&type=A
# source: https://dns.google/resolve?name=p131-fmfmobile.icloud.com&type=A

DOMAIN,gsp9-ssl.apple.com
DOMAIN,gsp10-ssl.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ls.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gs-loc.apple.com
DOMAIN,fmipmobile.icloud.com
DOMAIN,fmfmobile.icloud.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,p[0-9][0-9]-fmipmobile.icloud.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,p[0-9][0-9][0-9]-fmipmobile.icloud.com
DOMAIN,fmfmobile.fe2.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,p[0-9][0-9]-fmfmobile.icloud.com
DOMAIN-WILDCARD,p[0-9][0-9][0-9]-fmfmobile.icloud.com
